1. OAI/  (790 files)
   From OpenAI's mathematics repository, https://github.com/openai/math,
   commit fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb, directory lean/OAI/
   (the formalization accompanying "Catalan's constant is irrational", OpenAI, 2026).
   Only the files needed by this development are included. They were modified as follows:
   - each file was mechanically converted to Lean's module system (a `module` header,
     `public import`, and `@[expose] public section` after the imports);
   - minimal changes were made for Lean v4.35.0-rc2 and Mathlib v4.35.0-rc2 (see PORTING.md).
   Apart from this, the mathematical content and the declarations are unchanged.

2. PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/  (9 files)
   Files that OpenAI's repository adds to the PrimeNumberTheoremAnd project
   (https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd, commit
   c39a751132c88b6e8080b74c74023fd95b3d8be0) through its compatibility patch
   lean/patches/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd-lean4341.patch at the commit above.
   They were modified in the same way as item 1.

3. TauCeti/  (1 file)
   From the Tau Ceti project, https://github.com/TauCetiProject/TauCeti, commit
   d800e508b1b6f8b860c9395a0ea43dc4f5375b6c, file TauCeti/Analysis/SpecialFunctions/QPochhammer.lean,
   under the Apache License 2.0 (copyright The Tau Ceti contributors). Only the theta-product part of
   that file is included (qTheta, its quasi-periodicity, nonvanishing and holomorphy, and the Euler
   function nonvanishing). Modifications: the imports were narrowed to Mathlib modules; the declarations
   on Euler's identity, odd and level-two and level-three products, norm bounds and the UpperHalfPlane
   limit were removed; norm_pow_lt_one was reproved for normed fields. The file carries a header naming
   its source and changes.

4. scripts/, test/, docbuild/, .github/, Gemfile, Gemfile.lock
   From the Palomar submission template, https://github.com/PalomarRegistry/PalomarTemplate,
   adapted to this project.

Everything else (CatalanCore/, SolutionElliptic.lean, ChallengeElliptic.lean, comparator.json,
formalization.yaml, README.md, PORTING.md, paper/) is new work for this project.
